<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its 1997 earnings estimate on Advanced Micro Devices Inc to $0.75 a share from $0.27 a share and raised the 1998 earnings estimate to $2.25 a share from $1.53 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Advanced Micro lost two to 37-1/2.</p>
</text>
